      "message": "docs(process): a new integration test joins an existing directory suite\n\nAdd the rule \"New tests join a directory suite\" to AGENTS.md \"Testing\",\na cross-reference in \"Code shape\", check (d) in step 6 of\n.claude/agents/PR-reviewer.md and the decision entry. ISOLATED and\nSLOW_BINARIES are exempt.\n\nFixes #3187\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
